A||||7||MinnGreenGT||How to Keep a Healthy Level of Insanity (funny)||||1||
Z||000000||MinnGreenGT||12-17-2001||03:34 PM||||Just recieved this from my wife this morning...<P><B>How To Keep A Healthy Level Of Insanity:</B><P>1) At lunch time, sit in your parked car with sunglasses on and point a hair dryer at passing cars.    See if they slow down. <P>2) Page yourself over the intercom. Don't disguise your voice. <P>3) Insist that your e mail address is:    Xena-Warrior-Princess@edtsi.com or Elvis-the-King@edtsi.com <P>4) Every time someone asks you to do something, ask if they want fries with that. <P>5) Put your garbage can on your desk and label it "IN." <P>6) Develop an unnatural fear of staplers. <P>7) Put decaf in the coffee maker for 3 weeks. Once everyone has gotten over their caffeine addictions, switch to espresso. <P>8) In the memo field of all your checks, write "FOR SEXUAL FAVORS." <P>9) Finish all your sentences with "In accordance with the prophecy." <P>10) Dont use any punctuation <P>11) As often as possible, skip rather than walk. <P>12) Ask people what sex they are. Laugh hysterically after they answer. <P>13) Specify that your drive-through order is "to go." <P>14) Sing along at the opera. <P>15) Go to a poetry recital and ask why the poems don't rhyme. <P>16) Put mosquito netting around your cubicle. Play a tape of jungle sounds all day. <P>17) Five days in advance, tell your friends you can't attend their party because you're not in the mood. <P>18) Have your coworkers address you by your wrestling name, Rock Hard. <P>19) When the money comes out of the ATM, scream "I Won!", "I Won!" "3rd time this week!!!" <P>20) When leaving the zoo, start running towards the parking lot,  yelling "Run  for your lives, they're loose!"  <P>21) Tell your children over dinner. "Due to the economy, we are going to have to let one of you go." <P><B>And the final way to keep a healthy level of insanity...</B><P>22) Send this e-mail to everyone in your address book, even if they sent it to you or have asked you not to send them stuff like this. <BR><P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Ken Wittlief||12-17-2001||03:46 PM||||when you answer the phone dont say anything<P>eventually the caller will say: 'Hello?!'<P> then pretend you called them, and ask for yourself<P> see if you can get the other person to believe you both called your number at the same instant, and somehow the two incoming calls got cross connected<P> or when they say that 'you' are not there and that they are calling you, say " what do you think Im stupid or something?! I know hes there, just put him on the damn phone!"||||reg||1
Z||000002||JSocha||12-17-2001||03:58 PM||||If you have CALLER ID, this is even funnier.<P>If somebody calls you, get the name off of your Caller ID box of the incoming call and when you answer, "you" ask if so and so is there.<P>Confuses the party on the other end...they end up getting who you are asking for, even though you really had no intentions of talking to them  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> ...and by the time they realized what happened, you've got em.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||10
Z||000003||Formula88||12-17-2001||04:30 PM||||Fun with 3-way calling.<P>Call your local recorded "time" service, then call someone else.  They answer the phone to hear the time announcement.  <P>Another one, call two different people on 3-way calling and don't say anything.  Let them argue over who called who.  Amusing for several seconds at least.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000004||malacite||12-17-2001||06:04 PM||||call random people and ask them if you can borrow their dog. but just for a few minutes.<P><P>------------------<BR>Malacite<P>Grendel-88 Fiero RIP<BR>'94 Saturn SW2 RallySport<BR>'95 Saturn SL1 Touring||||reg||1
