Z||000007||Oreif||12-18-2001||01:12 AM||||Just answer the phone with:<BR>"Yeah, I'd like to order a large sausage and cheese pizza for delivery?"<BR>There is usually a 1/2 a second of silence then they respond "This isn't a pizza place"<BR>You then say "sorry I dialed the wrong number" and hang up. It takes a minute or so before they realized they called you!<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">            <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><B><I>Happiness isn't around the corner...<BR>Happiness IS the corner.</I></B></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 12-18-2001).]||||reg||1
